Copyright (c) 2026 Leonxlnx

Changes: the method and its formats rewritten as Zenvi tool calls (Zenvi
uses neither Remotion nor HyperFrames/GSAP), each technique's recipe rebuilt
with Zenvi tools with its 60 fps timings kept as frames and seconds, and
techniques that are an existing Zenvi move merged into it (CINETIC.md). No
cinetic code, starter, script, sound kit, film, image or brand is included.

Zenvi's adaptations of its scripts: the technique draw of scripts/pick.py in
packages/engine/src/brief/draw.ts, house.ts and cinetic-library.ts (the
library's categories, roles, energies, formats, evidence and banned looks);
the hard bans of SKILL.md and scripts/lint-film.mjs in
packages/engine/src/review/taste.ts; the speed check of measure-speed.py,
the AV-sync audit of av-audit.py, the text-flow gate of grid-check.ts and
the banding check of forensics.py in packages/engine/src/review/
motion-speed.ts, av-sync.ts, copy-pacing.ts, banding.ts and film-checks.ts;
its dithered gradients (finishing.md) as the deband pass of
packages/render-node/src/render/encoder.ts. The earshot sound kit cinetic
uses is not ported.

